# No credentials or environment variables required.
# Local-only demo uses http://localhost:48739 and ./data/eastbank.sqlite.
# Deliberately no bank, payroll, or model keys.

# Optional local/test-only overrides (the app ALWAYS binds loopback):
# EASTBANK_PORT=48739
# EASTBANK_DATA_DIR=./data
# Never point tests at real data. Integration tests use their own temp directory.
